      "start_time": 350.31,
      "end_time": 351.63
    },
    {
      "text": "You kind of already knew about the client concentration.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 351.67,
      "end_time": 353.678
    },
    {
      "text": "So I was just wondering maybe it was the, the personal issues and the timing was just bad and whether you would be interested in revisiting that as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 353.774,
      "end_time": 363.13
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I mean the client.",
