    {
      "text": "I mean it's an issue, but it's not necessarily the issue.",
      "speaker_name": "eric",
      "start_time": 378.198,
      "end_time": 380.27
    },
    {
      "text": "I think that ultimately the people that.",
      "speaker_name": "eric",
      "start_time": 380.31,
      "end_time": 383.678
    },
    {
      "text": "So our model is a integration model where we cross sell services into our other.",
      "speaker_name": "eric",
      "start_time": 383.734,
      "end_time": 389.726
    },
    {
      "text": "Other service offerings and we have.",
