    {
      "text": "We have a bunch of other services but pretty much full service at this point.",
      "speaker_name": "eric",
      "start_time": 391.75,
      "end_time": 395.246
    },
    {
      "text": "And so if you think about where it's Eileen right.",
      "speaker_name": "eric",
      "start_time": 395.398,
      "end_time": 402.18
    },
    {
      "text": "Where she was selling was kind of in a specific group like within the E commerce area.",
      "speaker_name": "eric",
      "start_time": 403.28,
      "end_time": 410.02
    },
    {
      "text": "And for us to try to get cross sell, we actually had a similar scenario with another company we bought that is kind of in a different area to try to get cross sell of other services.",
      "speaker_name": "eric",
      "start_time": 410.4,
      "end_time": 423.38
    },
    {
      "text": "And based on the fact.",
      "speaker_name": "eric",
      "start_time": 423.99,
      "end_time": 425.198
    },
    {
      "text": "So it's kind of like one of those scenarios where because there's only one client, you only have really one shot at trying to cross sell the services.",
      "speaker_name": "eric",
      "start_time": 425.254,
      "end_time": 433.502
    },
    {
      "text": "We felt like where they were was just not in the right spot in the organization for us to be able to do that.",
      "speaker_name": "eric",
      "start_time": 433.686,
      "end_time": 441.662
    },
    {
      "text": "And, you know, at the end of the day, I do think there's a risk that what she does will become more automated over time.",
      "speaker_name": "eric",
      "start_time": 441.766,
      "end_time": 449.902
    },
    {
      "text": "We saw that also with a company we acquired in the packaging space, that companies are looking for automation of a lot of what they do to bring budgets way down from like a million million and a half to like 3, 300,000, 400,000 for the same, same output because they're using AI.",
      "speaker_name": "eric",
      "start_time": 450.006,
      "end_time": 465.986
    },
    {
      "text": "So I think that was also a concern of ours.",
      "speaker_name": "eric",
      "start_time": 466.098,
      "end_time": 468.098
    },
    {
      "text": "So when you kind of put all that stuff together, it was just not unlikely for us to try to.",
      "speaker_name": "eric",
      "start_time": 468.114,
      "end_time": 473.49
    },
    {
      "text": "To be able to get, to get, get, get, get down the path.",
      "speaker_name": "eric",
      "start_time": 473.61,
      "end_time": 477.154
    },
    {
      "text": "We, we do have.",
      "speaker_name": "eric",
      "start_time": 477.202,
      "end_time": 477.842
    },
    {
      "text": "We have other acquisitions that, as I mentioned, we were kind of pursuing, and it just.",
      "speaker_name": "eric",
      "start_time": 477.866,
      "end_time": 483.004
    },
    {
      "text": "This one just kind of didn't fit the profile that.",
      "speaker_name": "eric",
      "start_time": 483.092,
      "end_time": 485.148
    },
    {
      "text": "That made.",
      "speaker_name": "eric",
      "start_time": 485.204,
      "end_time": 485.9
    },
    {
      "text": "After we kind of dug in a little bit and really understood more about the business and had some conversations outside and just about the technology world and where that's going, it just was too risky for us.",
