      "end_time": 505.736
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "eric",
      "start_time": 505.868,
      "end_time": 506.416
    },
    {
      "text": "And I think Eileen, as well, was upset because she really liked you and she wanted to get the deal done.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 506.528,
      "end_time": 514.048
    },
    {
      "text": "It was just.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 514.104,
      "end_time": 514.736
    },
    {
      "text": "She wanted a little bit more money up front, and then the whole carpet was pulled.",
