      "start_time": 514.808,
      "end_time": 518.272
    },
    {
      "text": "So.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 518.336,
      "end_time": 518.752
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, but that's.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 518.856,
      "end_time": 520.064
    },
    {
      "text": "That's fine.",
