      "start_time": 520.112,
      "end_time": 520.72
    },
    {
      "text": "I get it.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 520.8,
      "end_time": 521.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 521.32,
      "end_time": 521.584
    },
    {
      "text": "You know, there is a lot of AI coming in and replacing a big chunk of that industry in the future.",
