      "start_time": 528.92,
      "end_time": 535.32
    },
    {
      "text": "But.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 535.82,
      "end_time": 536.132
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, okay, fair enough.",
